  "measurement_note": "Size is N = P + R, the pattern length plus mapping count. Each tier aligns sub = a^P directly with s = b^P and places the required [a, b] mapping after R - 1 irrelevant distinct pairs, so all P positions must validate. Hashing the R mappings gives O(P + R) time on this workload within the general O(SP + R) bound. Correctly rescanning the mapping list for every unequal character completes all tiers and fails through O(PR) scaling.",
